lass=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ma\" data-defn=\"(question particle for &quot;yes-no&quot; questions)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">A</span><span class=\"tr\">A</span><rt></rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"méi yǒu\" data-defn=\"to not have\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">没有</span><span class=\"tr\">沒有</span><rt>méi yǒu</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā men\" data-defn=\"they; them\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xǐ huan\" data-defn=\"to like; to be fond of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huan</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā\" data-defn=\"classifier for families or businesses\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chī\" data-defn=\"to eat; to consume / to eat at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ de\" data-defn=\"my; mine\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hái zi\" data-defn=\"child\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">孩子</span><span class=\"tr\">孩子</span><rt>hái zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"men\" data-defn=\"plural marker for pronouns, and nouns referring to individuals\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">们</span><span class=\"tr\">們</span><rt>men</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lái\" data-defn=\"to come\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà\" data-defn=\"(specifier) that; the; those / (pronoun) that (referring to persons, things or situations)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ de\" data-defn=\"my; mine\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo gōng\" data-defn=\"(coll.) husband\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">老公</span><span class=\"tr\">老公</span><rt>lǎo gōng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo Sūn\" data-defn=\"a familiar way to refer to someone surnamed Sun; literally “Little Sun”\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">小孙</span><span class=\"tr\">小孫</span><rt>xiǎo Sūn</rt></ruby>；<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà\" data-defn=\"(specifier) that; the; those / (pronoun) that (referring to persons, things or situations)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt